{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cek8RZ7qDJ2pxuTi75Pdd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! All tests pass. Let me create a summary of the implementation:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Requirement**\nAdd `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that transitions a shipment from CREATED to CONFIRMED status, handles idempotent retries for already-CONFIRMED shipments, rejects CANCELLED shipments with HTTP 409, and returns HTTP 404 for unknown shipments.\n\n**Changed**\n1. `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt` — Added `SHIPMENT_CANCELLED` error code to the ErrorCode enum to represent the terminal state conflict when confirming a cancelled shipment.\n\n2. `sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt` — Added `confirm` endpoint that:\n   - Retrieves the shipment by ID (throws ResourceNotFoundException/404 if not found)\n   - Rejects CANCELLED shipments with ConflictException/409 using SHIPMENT_CANCELLED code\n   - Transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED status\n   - Treats already-CONFIRMED shipments as idempotent (no state change)\n   - Returns the updated shipment\n\n3. `sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt` — Added 4 tests covering:\n   - Confirming a CREATED shipment transitions it to CONFIRMED (test at lines 86-96)\n   - Confirming an already-CONFIRMED shipment succeeds idempotently (test at lines 99-117)\n   - Confirming a CANCELLED shipment returns 409 with SHIPMENT_CANCELLED error code (test at lines 120-136)\n   - Confirming a non-existent shipment returns 404 with SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND error code (test at lines 139-146)\n\n**Tests**\n- `confirms a shipment in CREATED status` — Verifies CREATED→CONFIRMED transition returns OK with updated status\n- `confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds and changes nothing` — Verifies idempotency of the confirm operation\n- `rejecting confirmation of a CANCELLED shipment with error envelope` — Verifies 409 conflict response with proper error envelope\n- `rejecting confirmation of non-existent shipment with error envelope` — Verifies 404 not found response with proper error envelope\n\n**Verification**\nRan `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`:\n- 17 tests total: 4 order tests, 1 app test, 9 shipment tests (5 existing + 4 new confirm tests), 3 customer tests\n- All tests pass\n- Build succeeds\n- No unrelated files modified\n- No dependencies added\n\n**Not done**\nNothing. All requirements from the ticket are implemented and verified."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1324,"cache_read_input_tokens":30431,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1324},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3f04ad2-1a16-4134-8216-26575dd5445e","uuid":"d751739f-c92a-4b9a-9a5e-395d1b93e001","timestamp":"2026-09-05T10:24:01.588Z","request_id":"req_011Cek8RY4qKDBiHLExUdQKH"}
